## Knowledge Capture
Run `learning-docs` frequently during project work to update LEARNING.md with:
- Bugs fixed & how, architectural decisions, lessons learned, pitfalls discovered

# Problem-Solving
FIX root cause, don't workaround. No disabling functionality. No duplicate templates.

# Subagents
Use subagents when tasks can run in parallel, require isolated context, or involve independent workstreams. Simple tasks, sequential ops, single-file edits → work directly.
